{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e01-scene-09",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "那是你的工位  (That Is Your Desk)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wang_er": "王尔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After Bu Xiaogu jumps in backstage to help with a costume emergency, Wang Er leads her into Xingtian's open-plan production floor, explains the rival departments, and shows her to her desk right outside Chun Yuqiao's office. Listen first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "工资还没拿呢，就干上活了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我看他们太忙了，就想上去帮把手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "今天是最轻松的一天了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你真正的战场应该是在这边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "星天有很多部门，这些部门之间都是平行的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "最重要的部门还是这边，淳于乔领导的制作部。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "那儿就是淳于乔的总编室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "那是你的工位，你坐那儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们好，我叫布小谷！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "工资还没拿呢，就干上活了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have not even collected your pay yet, and you have already started working?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我看他们太忙了，就想上去帮把手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I saw they were too busy, so I wanted to step up and lend a hand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "今天是最轻松的一天了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today is actually the easiest day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你真正的战场应该是在这边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your real battlefield should be over here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "星天有很多部门，这些部门之间都是平行的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian has many departments, and all of these departments are on equal footing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "最重要的部门还是这边，淳于乔领导的制作部。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, the most important department is right here: the production unit led by Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "那儿就是淳于乔的总编室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Over there is Chun Yuqiao's chief editor's office.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "那是你的工位，你坐那儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is your desk — you sit over there.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们好，我叫布小谷！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello everyone, my name is Bu Xiaogu!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "工资还没拿呢，就干上活了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我看他们太忙了，就想上去帮把手。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "今天是最轻松的一天了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你真正的战场应该是在这边。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "星天有很多部门，这些部门之间都是平行的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "最重要的部门还是这边，淳于乔领导的制作部。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "那儿就是淳于乔的总编室。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "那是你的工位，你坐那儿。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们好，我叫布小谷！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Xiaogu has found her desk, even if her exhausted neighbours barely look up from their screens. You learned \"gongwei\" for a desk spot, \"bangbashou\" for lending a hand, and plural \"nimen hao\".",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
